 # Architecture
+
+P14's current **1.8.8 candidate** fixes cold semantic-ready split admission
+within the existing owners. A claimed DestinationBuild job that explicitly requires
+semantic readiness selects the paired bundled model through the shared-model owner
+before Current initialization and source indexing. Kernel retains the collection
+writer and funding context for the policy/publication work; the helper validates
+the installed shared object set against paired default metadata. Metadata-only
+binding does not provision assets. No new crate, database, scheduler or source
+write is introduced. Actual Windows and scoped Neo positive cases passed on
+`d4e48a53…`; broader qualification and P14 acceptance remain pending.
 
